          %p
            %img{:src => "https://ncatlab.org/nlab/files/D6SuspendedNS5.png"}/
          %h4#D6BranesIntersectingD8BranesOverNS5Branes D6 branes intersecting D8-branes over NS5-branes
          %p
            …and on the other end, the D6-branes may
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/intersecting+branes"} end on
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D8-branes"} D8-branes
            over an NS5-brane (
            %a{:href => "#JanssenMeessenOrtin99"}> Janssen-Meessen-Ortin 99, Section 3
            ) yielding
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/D6-D8+brane+intersections"} D6-D8 brane intersections
            (for more detials see at
            = succeed "," do
