          %p
            Generally
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Dp-D%28p%2B2%29-brane+intersections"} Dp-D(p+2)-brane intersections
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometric+engineering+of+QFT"} geometrically engineer
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Yang-Mills+monopoles"} Yang-Mills monopoles
            in the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/worldvolume"} worldvolume
            of the higher dimensional D
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}>
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mi p
                  %mo +
                  %mn 2
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (p+2)
            \-branes.
          %p
            Specifically for
            = succeed "," do
